  "outlook": "Outlook for the Third Quarter Fiscal 2025: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $390.0 million to $400.0 million in the third quarter of fiscal 2025, compared to $373.9 million last year, a growth rate of 4.3% to 7.0%. Gross margin is expected to be in the range of 42.50% to 43.50% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 17.00% to 17.50%."
